        "type": "p",
        "text": "The first method is based on having divided the skin over the whole body into clearly defined areas, each assigned a corresponding essence. The map was drawn up by cross-referencing symptomatic manifestations, emotional states, and skin innervation. Through an in-depth interview, the tender areas are identified, along with the corresponding essences, and the most suitable combination is worked out."
